First: Pluslife products use an endogenous internal control. In single testing it effectively monitors sampling, extraction and amplification, but in pooled testing it can only monitor extraction and amplification. If the pool contains an improperly sampled positive sample, it is easily missed.
Second: the diluent volume in the kit is designed for single testing; pooling can easily throw off the sample-to-diluent ratio.','មិនណែនាំឱ្យធ្វើតេស្តសំណាករួមគ្នា (pooled testing) ទេ។
