2. Close the test card''s cap tightly.
3. Make sure there are no big bubbles in any chamber.
4. Shake the test card quickly 10 times; do not turn the card upside down.','1. ដាក់ Releasing Agent រហូតដល់កម្រិតទឹកនៅចន្លោះសញ្ញាទាំង 2។
