2. Wipe the surface of the device, the power button, the inside of the lid and the outside of the reaction module with a soft, lint-free cloth moistened with neutral detergent or 75% alcohol. Dry the residual water with a dry cloth to prevent corrosion.
3. Disinfect the surface of the device by UV irradiation for more than 30 minutes.','1. បិទម៉ាស៊ីន ដកកាតប្រតិកម្មចេញ ហើយពិនិត្យមើលថាកាតលេចធ្លាយឬអត់ និងមានទឹកសល់នៅក្នុងម៉ាស៊ីនឬអត់។
